["不花钱。难在火上来的那一刻停住手和嘴，还得换一套不打不骂的管法。换成什么管法，见本节第 17 条（教具体做法的家长课）。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["先看打。一篇荟萃分析只算「张开手打屁股或打手脚」这一种。它汇总了 75 项研究、111 个效果值，共 160927 名孩子。17 项结果里有 13 项和挨打明显有关，方向全是坏的。d 是效果大小，0.2 算小，0.5 算中等。小时候的攻击性 d = 0.37（95% CI 0.13–0.61，可信范围）。外显问题 0.41，指打人、违反规矩这类。内化问题 0.24，指焦虑、抑郁这类。心理健康问题 0.53，和父母关系差 0.51，自尊低 0.15，认知能力差 0.17。被父母施加身体虐待 0.64。长大后的反社会行为 0.36，心理健康问题 0.24。111 个效果值合起来是 d = 0.33（0.29–0.38）。孩子当场听不听话，和挨不挨打关系不明显（d = 0.14，−0.19–0.47），这一项只有 5 个效果值。另一篇综述只看前后跟踪的研究，共 69 项。体罚稳定地预示孩子之后的行为问题变多，没看到它和任何长期的好结果有关。其中 7 项研究看了打的次数，5 项发现打得越多、问题越重。再看吼骂。美国一项研究跟踪了 976 个父母双全的家庭。孩子 13 岁时，父母常吼叫、骂脏话、骂孩子笨或懒，孩子 13 到 14 岁之间闯祸和抑郁症状都增加。父母平时亲不亲热，都抵消不了这个关联。反过来也成立：13 岁时闯祸多的孩子，之后挨骂也更多。法律上，父母不得对孩子实施家庭暴力。《反家庭暴力法》第二条列了家庭暴力的方式：殴打、捆绑、残害、限制人身自由，以及经常性谩骂、恐吓。该法第十二条要求监护人用文明的方式进行家庭教育。父母侵犯孩子权益的，居委会、村委会要劝诫、制止，情节严重的报公安。公安、检察院、法院发现了，应当训诫父母，并可以责令他们接受家庭教育指导（全国）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原始出处"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Gershoff ET, Grogan-Kaylor A. (2016). Spanking and child outcomes: Old controversies and new meta-analyses. Journal of Family Psychology, 30(4), 453–469. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1037/fam0000191","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1037/fam0000191"]},"；Heilmann A, Mehay A, Watt RG, et al. (2021). Physical punishment and child outcomes: a narrative review of prospective studies. Lancet, 398(10297), 355–364. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(21)00582-1","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(21)00582-1"]},"；Wang MT, Kenny S. (2014). Longitudinal links between fathers' and mothers' harsh verbal discipline and adolescents' conduct problems and depressive symptoms. Child Development, 85(3), 908–923. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1111/cdev.12143","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1111/cdev.12143"]},"；Ferguson CJ. (2013). Spanking, corporal punishment and negative long-term outcomes: a meta-analytic review of longitudinal studies. Clinical Psychology Review, 33(1), 196–208. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cpr.2012.11.002","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cpr.2012.11.002"]},"；Larzelere RE, Kuhn BR. (2005). Comparing child outcomes of physical punishment and alternative disciplinary tactics: a meta-analysis. Clinical Child and Family Psychology Review, 8(1), 1–37. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10567-005-2340-z","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1007/s10567-005-2340-z"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2015). 反家庭暴力法（第二、十二条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf7f9d60889","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf7f9d60889"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2024 年修正). 未成年人保护法（第十一、十七、一百一十八条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8081818f197cf001905e567af635a0","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8081818f197cf001905e567af635a0"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2021). 家庭教育促进法（第二十三、五十三条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8081817cac3b2d017cac5a6c6f0109","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8081817cac3b2d017cac5a6c6f0109"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1037/fam0000191","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["打开来源链接"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["争议。这些研究几乎都只是跟踪记录、没有分组对照，说明不了谁导致谁。打屁股那篇荟萃里，72% 的研究只看两件事是否一起出现，或者靠事后回忆。另一篇荟萃只收前后跟踪的研究，扣掉孩子原来的行为之后，打屁股和外显问题的关联只剩 0.07，和内化问题只剩 0.10。那篇的作者认为影响很小。还有一篇荟萃发现，「有条件地打」在减少不听话和反社会行为上，比 13 种别的管法里的 10 种效果好。它也发现，打得过重或者以打为主，就比别的管法差。所以反方能说明的是：少量、有条件地打，未必比别的管法差。打得重、常打常骂，两边都认为更差。偶尔打一下、吼一句，法条没有明说就是家暴，它点名的是殴打和经常性的谩骂、恐吓。受益人主要是孩子。家里别人打孩子，报警和申请保护令见第 8 节第 43 条（人身安全保护令）。看到别人家长期打孩子，任何人都有权劝阻，或者向公安、民政、教育部门检举。对陌生人家里的事，打 110 或者告诉居委会就够了，别自己上门拉架。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/30-15"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"孩子说自己喜欢同性，别骂、别赶出家门、别送去「矫正」：家里的态度和他会不会自杀有关"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/30-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"孩子难管、自己总忍不住打骂，去上一期教具体做法的家长课"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-10"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["睡眠、作业、体育和排名都有明文规定，学校做不到可以提"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["文件写明，小学生每天睡 10 小时，初中 9 小时，高中 8 小时。小学上午上课一般不早于 8:20，中学不早于 8:00。2025 年又…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-11"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["孩子撑不住了可以休学，学籍学校必须给他留着，最长 1 年"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["休学有正式制度。父母或其他监护人提出申请，学校确认后报上级核准。一次最长 1 年，期满还要休就重新申请。休学期间学校要给孩子保留学籍，复学…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-12"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["查出视力不良，去医院做散瞳验光，之后按医生给的间隔复查"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["散瞳验光是先滴一种眼药水，让眼睛里负责调焦的肌肉松下来，再验度数。这是在医院做的，诊断近视最准。卫健委写明这种药水对健康的眼睛不会造成损伤…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-13"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["恒磨牙长出来以后做窝沟封闭"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["窝沟封闭是把大牙咬东西那一面的沟槽用树脂封住，食物残渣就塞不进去。做完两年，长蛀牙的机会约为不封的八分之一。不封时有 16% 的牙面会蛀，…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-14"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["孩子爱打游戏，先看睡觉、作业和出门活动有没有被挤掉，别光盯着玩了多久"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["真正够得上「游